# __PROJECT_NAME__ — project entrypoint

Read `CLAUDE.md` when present for project constraints.
**Explicit worker assignment takes precedence over generic lead routing.**
Workers read only their assigned role contract and task evidence; do not invoke
the `feature` skill, read leader rules, or dispatch another team.

For unassigned feature/bug-fix work: Claude uses `/feature`, Codex invokes the
`feature` skill, OpenCode uses `/feature` with its leader agent. Each loads
`.agent-pipeline/roles/leader.md` and only needed backend adapters.
Toolkit updates use `toolkit-update`, at an idle task boundary.
The task record is the handoff surface; replies are short receipts except
read-only reviewers returning findings for the lead to persist unchanged.

